1
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:06,268
We have to make our move now.

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,720
We don't know when those two who were arrested might talk.

3
00:00:09,213 --> 00:00:10,560
from now on,

4
00:00:10,931 --> 00:00:12,040
please remember one thing,

5
00:00:12,211 --> 00:00:13,960
I never meant to hurt you.

6
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,320
Come here and take him home!

7
00:00:16,334 --> 00:00:18,835
You are the honor of this family.

8
00:00:19,112 --> 00:00:21,720
If having that honor means living without Phob,

9
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,040
- then I don't want it.
- Tin!

10
00:00:26,139 --> 00:00:28,720
I want you to have it all. Take it, build a life for yourself,

11
00:00:28,976 --> 00:00:31,320
and be with the one you love.

12
00:00:32,091 --> 00:00:35,320
Khana Ratsadon has taken control of the government already.

13
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,241
[Noppalak Palace]

14
00:02:19,678 --> 00:02:20,679
You traitorous rebel!

15
00:02:22,152 --> 00:02:23,840
How dare you go against the Crown's authority?

16
00:02:25,206 --> 00:02:27,560
You are leading Siam to its destruction!

17
00:02:30,934 --> 00:02:32,960
We're creating a new Siam.

18
00:02:34,766 --> 00:02:36,000
The old system has failed.

19
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:39,080
It's holding our country back.

20
00:02:41,368 --> 00:02:44,000
This land belongs to the people.

21
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,960
Everyone deserves equal rights.

22
00:02:49,534 --> 00:02:51,120
Equal rights?

23
00:02:53,630 --> 00:02:54,631
You really believe that?

24
00:02:55,643 --> 00:02:59,200
Do you think those fancy ideals can actually build a nation?

25
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:00,841
At least,

26
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,120
it gives hope to people who've got nothing.

27
00:03:05,059 --> 00:03:08,840
So you think destroying everything we've built is the answer?

28
00:03:11,771 --> 00:03:12,840
If what we have now

29
00:03:14,454 --> 00:03:16,360
keeps most people at the bottom,

30
00:03:16,992 --> 00:03:18,600
then it deserves to be changed.

31
00:03:20,678 --> 00:03:22,000
We're doing this for our country.

32
00:03:23,056 --> 00:03:24,520
For our country?

33
00:03:25,494 --> 00:03:28,000
You've got some nerve saying that after everything you've done.

34
00:03:31,558 --> 00:03:32,800
I'm doing this for the greater good.

35
00:03:34,251 --> 00:03:35,360
I haven't betrayed anyone.

36
00:03:37,206 --> 00:03:39,120
You betrayed me!

37
00:03:40,731 --> 00:03:44,200
I raised you and paid for your education.

38
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:47,760
And now you stand here, acting all superior to me?

39
00:03:53,539 --> 00:03:54,540
An education?

40
00:03:56,184 --> 00:03:57,688
Just so I can serve the royals?

41
00:04:00,931 --> 00:04:04,518
They only want smart servants to do their bidding.

42
00:04:05,835 --> 00:04:08,822
So that's how you've felt all this time

43
00:04:09,702 --> 00:04:11,720
while you were living at Varakulvatin Palace?

44
00:04:22,478 --> 00:04:25,939
I'll always be grateful to the palace.

45
00:04:27,912 --> 00:04:29,200
But I have to stand with the people.

46
00:04:31,192 --> 00:04:32,920
How admirable.

47
00:04:34,494 --> 00:04:36,360
Captain Phobthee will do anything

48
00:04:37,038 --> 00:04:39,320
to achieve your goal.

49
00:04:41,054 --> 00:04:44,120
Even getting close to Tinnakorn again was part of your plan, wasn't it?

50
00:04:44,275 --> 00:04:45,600
I truly love Prince Tinnakorn.

51
00:04:46,588 --> 00:04:49,320
Someone as wicked as you actually knows what love is?

52
00:04:54,792 --> 00:04:57,000
You never saw me as your equal.

53
00:04:59,710 --> 00:05:02,120
You never believed my love was real, because I was nothing more than a servant.

54
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,720
But this lowly servant will prove

55
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:07,440
that everyone deserves equal rights,

56
00:05:07,603 --> 00:05:09,804
dignity, and the right to love.

57
00:05:10,371 --> 00:05:14,440
Love is for those who are honest and sincere,

58
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:17,480
not for someone who's willing to use it as a weapon.

59
00:05:22,838 --> 00:05:24,400
I stand by my words.

60
00:05:26,301 --> 00:05:27,920
I truly love Prince Tinnakorn.

61
00:05:30,355 --> 00:05:31,356
Are you sure?

62
00:05:33,347 --> 00:05:36,880
Are you sure you never used Tinnakorn for your political agenda?

63
00:05:40,307 --> 00:05:42,595
No matter how much you change the world,

64
00:05:43,176 --> 00:05:45,120
and make everyone equal,

65
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:48,280
you'll never be worthy of him.

66
00:06:14,542 --> 00:06:15,543
Oy!

67
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:20,050
- Can you give this back to Grandma?
- Yes, Your Highness.

68
00:06:24,062 --> 00:06:25,139
Let me go!

69
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:28,840
You traitors! I will kill you all!

70
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,161
- Chat! Hey!
- Tin! Help me!

71
00:06:31,171 --> 00:06:33,240
- Chat!
- Your Highness!

72
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,680
Please, don't follow him.

73
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,080
I need to help my brother.

74
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,520
We don't know who we can trust right now.

75
00:06:39,216 --> 00:06:41,560
I'm afraid they might take you as well.

76
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:44,000
How is everyone?

77
00:06:44,462 --> 00:06:46,600
Your grandma and the rest of us are safe.

78
00:06:47,134 --> 00:06:51,440
But we didn't hear anything from your father.

79
00:06:52,296 --> 00:06:53,297
Dad?

80
00:06:56,115 --> 00:06:59,016
Why didn't you run away with Phob?

81
00:06:59,448 --> 00:07:01,449
I didn't even get to see Phob before everything happened.

82
00:07:03,875 --> 00:07:04,876
I totally forgot.

83
00:07:06,883 --> 00:07:07,884
Phob is a soldier.

84
00:07:09,107 --> 00:07:11,760
I will ask him to help us.

85
00:07:12,467 --> 00:07:14,200
- Okay.
- I need to find him.

86
00:07:14,323 --> 00:07:15,600
Please be careful.

87
00:07:20,099 --> 00:07:22,720
HTMS Sukhothai should arrive in Hua Hin tomorrow morning.

88
00:07:24,368 --> 00:07:25,670
Once His Majesty

89
00:07:27,227 --> 00:07:29,360
receives the petition inviting him to return,

90
00:07:30,742 --> 00:07:33,451
we'll know whether the country will remain peaceful...

91
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,280
or be plunged into bloodshed.

92
00:07:44,688 --> 00:07:48,360
We've reinforced all the strategic positions around the capital.

93
00:07:52,358 --> 00:07:54,240
If the provincial troops try to march back in,

94
00:07:57,307 --> 00:07:59,000
they'll have to get past our guns first.

95
00:08:02,315 --> 00:08:05,640
Keep the members of the royal family in custody. No disturbances

96
00:08:06,475 --> 00:08:08,480
until we receive word from Hua Hin.

97
00:08:09,446 --> 00:08:10,447
Yes, sir.

98
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:36,561
I heard you went to talk to Prince Vasin, how did it go?

99
00:08:38,088 --> 00:08:39,089
What do you think?

100
00:08:41,395 --> 00:08:42,840
He was furious at us,

101
00:08:44,048 --> 00:08:45,249
he called us rebels.

102
00:08:47,787 --> 00:08:48,920
He also accused me of

103
00:08:50,342 --> 00:08:51,800
using Prince Tinnakorn.

104
00:08:55,446 --> 00:08:58,920
Prince Tinnakorn is staying at the house you rented, isn't he?

105
00:09:02,422 --> 00:09:05,880
Once this is over, you have to explain it to him.

106
00:09:06,230 --> 00:09:07,440
Make him understand that we did this for the people.

107
00:09:16,107 --> 00:09:18,200
I just hope Prince Tinnakorn will understand.

108
00:09:38,416 --> 00:09:40,448
Phob! You're back.

109
00:09:41,334 --> 00:09:42,600
Are you okay, honey?

110
00:09:43,678 --> 00:09:44,720
I'm fine, Mom.

111
00:09:46,465 --> 00:09:48,520
The whole city is in chaos.

112
00:09:48,942 --> 00:09:52,440
They say the rebels have rounded up all the royals.

113
00:09:52,792 --> 00:09:54,080
I was so afraid something might happen to you.

114
00:09:56,016 --> 00:09:57,500
I wonder

115
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,704
how everyone at Varakulvatin Palace is holding up.

116
00:10:03,398 --> 00:10:06,600
It's alright, Mom. The soldiers are taking care of them.

117
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,601
Taking care of?

118
00:10:10,601 --> 00:10:11,602
How?

119
00:10:13,838 --> 00:10:16,700
Keep an eye on them.

120
00:10:18,979 --> 00:10:20,440
The soldiers are there to prevent any trouble.

121
00:10:23,422 --> 00:10:26,755
As for Prince Wasin, he's currently being held at Noppalak Palace.

122
00:10:28,046 --> 00:10:29,847
If the situation remains peaceful

123
00:10:30,222 --> 00:10:32,200
and the royals accept the change in government,

124
00:10:32,392 --> 00:10:33,720
we'll release him.

125
00:10:38,211 --> 00:10:39,212
We?

126
00:10:41,032 --> 00:10:42,033
You mean…

127
00:10:45,374 --> 00:10:46,375
you…

128
00:10:49,848 --> 00:10:51,120
you are a rebel?

129
00:10:53,019 --> 00:10:54,040
It's not like that.

130
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:57,560
Rebels are those who betray their country

131
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,736
for personal power.

132
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,640
We're fighting for the power of the people.

133
00:11:06,067 --> 00:11:09,250
By betraying the people who took you in?

134
00:11:15,686 --> 00:11:18,219
How could you do this?

135
00:11:20,075 --> 00:11:22,360
Even a dog knows better.

136
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:27,020
It would never bite the hand that feeds it.

137
00:11:29,408 --> 00:11:31,100
We are not dogs.

138
00:11:31,947 --> 00:11:34,600
We don't have to be grateful for whatever scraps they throw our way.

139
00:11:39,686 --> 00:11:42,440
We're all human, including the royals.

140
00:11:43,291 --> 00:11:45,614
We deserve the same dignity and respect.

141
00:11:46,691 --> 00:11:48,650
We shouldn't have to bow to them forever.

142
00:11:53,091 --> 00:11:54,092
At first,

143
00:11:55,219 --> 00:11:57,800
when you went back to Prince Tinnakorn,

144
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:04,774
I thought it was because you still loved him... that you could never let him go.

145
00:12:06,555 --> 00:12:11,000
But was this the real reason you went back to him?

146
00:12:17,587 --> 00:12:19,700
I did what I had to do.

147
00:13:16,478 --> 00:13:19,000
Phob, have you heard the rumors

148
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:22,000
about a plot to overthrow the government?

149
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,000
Yes, I've heard about it.

150
00:13:25,985 --> 00:13:28,400
Stay away from those people.

151
00:13:30,163 --> 00:13:31,720
My dad used to suspect you to be one of them.

152
00:13:32,784 --> 00:13:34,240
I don't want you to be in danger.

153
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,401
P.T.

154
00:13:49,736 --> 00:13:50,737
Phobthee.

155
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,281
Tinnakorn.

156
00:13:57,251 --> 00:13:59,100
Phob, do you like it?

157
00:14:00,723 --> 00:14:03,000
I asked them to make it special for us.

158
00:14:04,134 --> 00:14:05,135
Of course, I do.

159
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,361
Phob! Oh!

160
00:14:11,094 --> 00:14:12,095
Put me down.

161
00:14:13,742 --> 00:14:16,500
Why? Why, Phob? Why!

162
00:14:21,992 --> 00:14:22,993
Why?

163
00:14:41,024 --> 00:14:42,500
Why?

164
00:14:57,368 --> 00:14:59,875
Who's that? Who is sitting here?

165
00:15:01,075 --> 00:15:03,374
What? Tinnakorn?

166
00:15:03,686 --> 00:15:06,560
What is going on? Why are you sitting here?

167
00:15:06,696 --> 00:15:08,600
I thought you went to see Phob.

168
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,481
Darling?

169
00:15:13,696 --> 00:15:14,697
What's wrong?

170
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:18,361
Tinnakorn? Aum, faster!

171
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,640
[June 25, 1932]

172
00:15:25,518 --> 00:15:27,144
I hope they choose to surrender.

173
00:15:27,827 --> 00:15:29,800
I don't want this to escalate into a civil war.

174
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:37,500
Any news from Hua Hin, sir?

175
00:15:38,096 --> 00:15:39,350
What did the royals say?

176
00:15:42,779 --> 00:15:43,780
His Majesty

177
00:15:44,808 --> 00:15:48,040
will grant us the constitution we've requested.

178
00:15:52,450 --> 00:15:54,800
Come on, everyone! The revolution has begun!

179
00:15:59,238 --> 00:16:02,120
We did it, Phob! Siam is going to change!

180
00:16:09,430 --> 00:16:11,000
You're worried about Prince Tinnakorn, aren't you?

181
00:16:17,576 --> 00:16:19,500
I will explain to him and make him understand.

182
00:16:29,672 --> 00:16:31,920
His Majesty issued a royal letter in response to

183
00:16:32,648 --> 00:16:37,320
the Khana Ratsadon 's Military Committee for the Defense of the Capital, stating:

184
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:41,160
"For the sake of peace and order among my people,"

185
00:16:41,326 --> 00:16:43,000
"I do not wish to see any bloodshed."

186
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:46,071
"In truth, I had already been considering"

187
00:16:46,081 --> 00:16:48,082
"a change along these very lines."

188
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:50,240
"I therefore agree to serve as a figurehead,"

189
00:16:50,250 --> 00:16:53,512
"so that the establishment of the new government"

190
00:16:53,587 --> 00:16:56,520
"and the adoption of a constitution may proceed smoothly."

191
00:16:56,654 --> 00:16:59,800
"For if I were to refuse this role,"

192
00:16:59,974 --> 00:17:02,830
"foreign nations would likely refuse to recognize the new government."

193
00:17:10,926 --> 00:17:12,500
What does it mean, Your Highness?

194
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,700
His Majesty didn't want to see the people shed each other's blood.

195
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:27,801
And to keep the country moving forward

196
00:17:29,112 --> 00:17:31,440
without any more turmoil,

197
00:17:33,539 --> 00:17:35,600
he agreed to the change in Siam's system of government.

198
00:17:49,094 --> 00:17:51,250
The King didn't want to see the country thrown into chaos,

199
00:17:51,888 --> 00:17:54,360
so he agreed to the Khana Ratsadon's requests.

200
00:17:58,728 --> 00:17:59,729
No! No!

201
00:18:00,278 --> 00:18:01,279
This is not true!

202
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:05,391
No! No!

203
00:18:12,256 --> 00:18:15,067
Listen up, everyone. Gather around!

204
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:17,200
The King has agreed!

205
00:18:17,343 --> 00:18:20,044
As His Majesty King Prajadhipok

206
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:23,700
has signed

207
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:28,840
the Temporary Constitution of the Kingdom of Siam, B.E. 2475 (1932),

208
00:18:28,928 --> 00:18:33,400
From this day forward, supreme authority shall reside in the People's Assembly.

209
00:18:33,462 --> 00:18:36,280
The affairs of state shall be administered

210
00:18:36,406 --> 00:18:38,680
under the supervision of its executive body,

211
00:18:38,707 --> 00:18:41,840
known as the People's Committee of Siam.

212
00:19:02,403 --> 00:19:04,640
It is over now, Your Highness.

213
00:19:12,936 --> 00:19:14,320
Everything proceeded peacefully.

214
00:19:16,451 --> 00:19:17,720
We are not rebels.

215
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:22,100
We are carrying out His Majesty's wishes,

216
00:19:23,339 --> 00:19:26,320
wishes he accepted to spare the nation from bloodshed.

217
00:19:32,979 --> 00:19:34,840
You wretched traitors!

218
00:19:35,982 --> 00:19:37,400
You forced His Majesty into agreeing to it.

219
00:19:41,408 --> 00:19:43,200
His Majesty has acted in the nation's best interests.

220
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:47,480
You should respect His Majesty's wishes and

221
00:19:49,622 --> 00:19:51,200
not bring about any further unrest.

222
00:19:53,686 --> 00:19:57,100
From this day on, Siam belongs to all its people,

223
00:20:01,288 --> 00:20:02,520
not only the aristocracy.

224
00:20:05,630 --> 00:20:08,120
Don't think it'll be that easy.

225
00:20:10,118 --> 00:20:11,640
As long as I'm alive,

226
00:20:12,502 --> 00:20:14,280
you'll never get what you want.

227
00:20:15,499 --> 00:20:17,600
I'll never surrender to the likes of you.

228
00:20:21,014 --> 00:20:22,300
As for Tinnakorn,

229
00:20:23,643 --> 00:20:25,560
I am certain he will not forgive you.

230
00:20:34,096 --> 00:20:35,720
I'll escort you back to the palace.

231
00:20:40,097 --> 00:20:41,098
This way, please.

232
00:21:02,859 --> 00:21:05,150
How is Tinnakorn?

233
00:21:05,574 --> 00:21:08,000
The prince is up but he still looks exhausted.

234
00:21:09,067 --> 00:21:11,240
What was going on with him?

235
00:21:11,294 --> 00:21:12,880
I thought he went to see Phob,

236
00:21:13,118 --> 00:21:14,760
but where is Phob?

237
00:21:15,054 --> 00:21:19,280
Vasin and Chatthorn haven't been home either.

238
00:21:19,475 --> 00:21:22,600
Aum, I'm starting to get worried. What should I do?

239
00:21:23,992 --> 00:21:25,200
Chat, darling?

240
00:21:25,683 --> 00:21:27,400
How are you?

241
00:21:28,691 --> 00:21:30,960
Have a seat next to me. How are you doing?

242
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:35,600
I'm fine. They kept me in jail

243
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:36,801
and they just released me.

244
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:39,880
May you be blessed, and may Heaven watch over you, darling.

245
00:21:44,654 --> 00:21:46,560
Prince Vasin is here, Your Highness.

246
00:21:56,732 --> 00:21:57,733
Dad?

247
00:22:05,510 --> 00:22:07,360
Everything is under control,

248
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:11,100
so I escorted Prince Vasin back safely.

249
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,501
Thank you so much Phob,

250
00:22:13,758 --> 00:22:16,600
for taking care of my son.

251
00:22:19,134 --> 00:22:21,120
You don't need to thank him.

252
00:22:21,235 --> 00:22:22,236
Why's that?

253
00:22:22,300 --> 00:22:23,311
He's one of the rebels.

254
00:22:23,864 --> 00:22:24,865
What?

255
00:22:25,262 --> 00:22:26,263
Phob!

256
00:22:29,544 --> 00:22:30,545
You rebel!

257
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,520
You think you can change anything?

258
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:34,848
You can change the entire kingdom,

259
00:22:35,083 --> 00:22:37,240
but you'll never change the servant's blood running through your veins.

260
00:22:37,707 --> 00:22:39,708
In the end, you'll always be nothing more than lowborn.

261
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:44,950
Noblemen like you are the very reason

262
00:22:46,038 --> 00:22:49,080
the old regime had to fall.

263
00:22:50,656 --> 00:22:54,720
It upheld a system that allowed those born into nobility

264
00:22:55,579 --> 00:22:57,200
to oppress others

265
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,360
and take advantage of people

266
00:23:01,456 --> 00:23:03,240
regardless of their ability.

267
00:23:04,059 --> 00:23:07,083
They relied solely on the privilege of their birth while bleeding the nation dry.

268
00:23:07,136 --> 00:23:08,160
- Phob!
- Phob!

269
00:23:12,470 --> 00:23:13,619
Let me ask you one thing.

270
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:17,600
So, you truly think we're that cruel?

271
00:23:18,270 --> 00:23:21,240
That we've oppressed you so terribly?

272
00:23:25,395 --> 00:23:26,930
That's not what I meant.

273
00:23:30,494 --> 00:23:33,720
I've always been grateful for your kindness

274
00:23:35,662 --> 00:23:37,880
But we need changes in this country.

275
00:23:39,779 --> 00:23:40,780
Whatever.

276
00:23:41,656 --> 00:23:45,400
Be that as it may, I appreciate you

277
00:23:45,979 --> 00:23:48,240
bringing my son home.

278
00:23:48,859 --> 00:23:50,360
Vasin, let's go.

279
00:23:51,792 --> 00:23:55,000
We shouldn't take up any more of

280
00:23:55,171 --> 00:23:57,760
Captain Phobthee's valuable time.

281
00:23:58,664 --> 00:23:59,665
Let's go, darling.

282
00:24:07,083 --> 00:24:08,084
Your Highness!

283
00:24:08,379 --> 00:24:09,380
- Your Highness!
- Stop!

284
00:24:10,971 --> 00:24:11,972
You need to leave now!

285
00:24:13,251 --> 00:24:14,252
Go!

286
00:24:15,110 --> 00:24:17,160
And don't ever set foot in this palace again.

287
00:24:18,902 --> 00:24:20,400
I need to talk to Prince Tinnakorn.

288
00:24:20,779 --> 00:24:22,560
- Your Highness!
- My son wouldn't want to speak…

289
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:23,995
to a traitor like you!

290
00:24:25,112 --> 00:24:26,113
Get out of here!

291
00:24:27,150 --> 00:24:30,520
Don't think for a second that I'm scared of you just because you've got power.

292
00:24:32,040 --> 00:24:33,041
Go!

293
00:24:33,816 --> 00:24:34,817
- Your Highness!
- Go!

294
00:24:34,843 --> 00:24:37,720
Phob, we need to leave! We don't want any trouble.

295
00:25:15,328 --> 00:25:16,329
Dad?

296
00:25:21,019 --> 00:25:22,020
Dad, I'm sorry.

297
00:25:25,414 --> 00:25:27,100
I was so stupid.

298
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,180
It all happened because of me.

299
00:25:33,144 --> 00:25:34,145
I'm sorry.

300
00:25:39,635 --> 00:25:40,760
You did nothing wrong.

301
00:25:41,864 --> 00:25:43,960
It was all Phob's fault.

302
00:25:45,225 --> 00:25:47,806
He hurt you, he hurt all of us,

303
00:25:49,139 --> 00:25:50,140
you understand?

304
00:25:53,918 --> 00:25:55,880
I won't let this end easily.

305
00:25:57,422 --> 00:25:59,560
They are the ones who will be defeated.

306
00:26:00,580 --> 00:26:03,840
They will pay for the evil they've they have done to our nation.

307
00:26:08,121 --> 00:26:09,320
But it started because of me.

308
00:26:13,352 --> 00:26:14,353
I'm sorry.

309
00:26:33,832 --> 00:26:34,833
You should drink this.

310
00:26:51,190 --> 00:26:52,400
Don't think too much about it, Phob.

311
00:26:54,576 --> 00:26:57,560
If Prince Tinnakorn were to hear your side of the story,

312
00:26:58,900 --> 00:27:01,040
you might understand him better.

313
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,800
We succeeded in changing the country,

314
00:27:22,238 --> 00:27:23,720
yet I was left with no one.

315
00:27:31,558 --> 00:27:32,650
My mom is mad at me.

316
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,360
Prince Tinnakorn…

317
00:27:40,544 --> 00:27:41,545
also left me.

318
00:27:47,936 --> 00:27:48,937
In the end...

319
00:27:51,854 --> 00:27:52,920
was the path I chose

320
00:27:56,467 --> 00:27:57,720
truly worth it?

321
00:28:05,299 --> 00:28:07,640
No one can answer that in just a day or two, Phob.

322
00:28:09,370 --> 00:28:10,500
What we've done

323
00:28:11,811 --> 00:28:14,240
is far too great for people to understand overnight.

324
00:28:16,520 --> 00:28:17,880
What should I do?

325
00:28:19,043 --> 00:28:20,044
Show the world

326
00:28:21,619 --> 00:28:23,520
that what we did was not in vain.

327
00:28:24,968 --> 00:28:27,100
Show them that it truly made our nation better.

328
00:28:28,360 --> 00:28:29,361
So that one day,

329
00:28:30,787 --> 00:28:34,280
everyone who suffered and everyone who lost someone because of this

330
00:28:35,726 --> 00:28:38,100
will know their sacrifice was not for nothing.

331
00:28:49,475 --> 00:28:50,560
I don't know

332
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:53,720
how long it'll take.

333
00:28:54,982 --> 00:28:56,280
Right now, all I want…

334
00:28:57,942 --> 00:29:01,852
is to see and speak to him one more time.

335
00:29:13,822 --> 00:29:14,823
Phob,

336
00:29:16,672 --> 00:29:18,360
I can think of someone who can help you.

337
00:29:38,483 --> 00:29:39,484
Princess Ruethaisiri?

338
00:29:40,718 --> 00:29:43,760
Thank you for coming here to see me.

339
00:30:00,230 --> 00:30:02,960
Is it true that you're one of them?

340
00:30:04,843 --> 00:30:05,844
Yes,

341
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:08,880
I am one of their supporters.

342
00:30:10,360 --> 00:30:12,120
Do you despise me for it?

343
00:30:18,147 --> 00:30:22,400
My father said that you resented the nobility like us,

344
00:30:22,790 --> 00:30:24,480
and would lead the nation to ruin.

345
00:30:29,155 --> 00:30:31,640
Do you truly think I'm that kind of person?

346
00:30:34,707 --> 00:30:36,300
I don't know what to think.

347
00:30:38,488 --> 00:30:40,100
This change

348
00:30:41,350 --> 00:30:43,720
may have taken something away

349
00:30:44,347 --> 00:30:45,960
from noblewomen like you.

350
00:30:48,251 --> 00:30:49,500
But at the same time,

351
00:30:50,100 --> 00:30:53,720
it has given countless others what they never had before.

352
00:30:55,351 --> 00:30:56,400
Really?

353
00:30:59,112 --> 00:31:01,040
Until now, Siam's future

354
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:03,441
has been decided by only a handful of people.

355
00:31:07,339 --> 00:31:09,500
But from this day forward, whether rich or poor,

356
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:13,920
every one of us will have a say in our nation's future.

357
00:31:16,742 --> 00:31:18,300
Including me?

358
00:31:20,760 --> 00:31:23,320
That's right. You will have the freedom

359
00:31:24,507 --> 00:31:26,520
to choose what you want to do,

360
00:31:27,195 --> 00:31:28,600
to choose your own life,

361
00:31:29,467 --> 00:31:31,560
instead of living the life others have chosen for you.

362
00:31:35,664 --> 00:31:38,840
Perhaps, my father was wrong.

363
00:31:51,510 --> 00:31:52,511
Actually,

364
00:31:53,664 --> 00:31:56,720
I asked to see you today

365
00:31:59,688 --> 00:32:02,440
because I have a favor to ask of you.

366
00:32:11,594 --> 00:32:14,000
Thank you for checking in on us.

367
00:32:15,488 --> 00:32:17,760
How is your father holding up?

368
00:32:18,982 --> 00:32:20,800
He is doing good, sir.

369
00:32:24,070 --> 00:32:27,000
Your Highness, Mr. Adul is asking to see you.

370
00:32:58,382 --> 00:32:59,383
My beloved prince,

371
00:33:01,382 --> 00:33:02,720
I'm not sure

372
00:33:03,265 --> 00:33:06,240
whether you still wish to read this letter.

373
00:33:07,939 --> 00:33:09,600
Even so, I still wanted to write it,

374
00:33:11,667 --> 00:33:15,400
though I no longer have the right to ask anything from you.

375
00:33:16,238 --> 00:33:19,240
I know what I did

376
00:33:20,679 --> 00:33:22,850
shattered your trust in me

377
00:33:23,619 --> 00:33:25,000
beyond forgiveness.

378
00:33:30,598 --> 00:33:31,920
There were times I wondered

379
00:33:34,577 --> 00:33:35,778
if everything could have been different

380
00:33:38,355 --> 00:33:41,180
had I chosen otherwise.

381
00:33:47,438 --> 00:33:48,960
But I had no choice.

382
00:33:51,390 --> 00:33:52,760
What I saw

383
00:33:55,523 --> 00:33:58,320
was never just about you and me.

384
00:33:59,678 --> 00:34:02,960
It was about countless people

385
00:34:03,568 --> 00:34:06,760
who were never given the chance to choose their own lives.

386
00:34:08,160 --> 00:34:09,920
I wanted to see a world

387
00:34:11,339 --> 00:34:13,760
where no one would have to suffer simply

388
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,500
because they were born beneath someone else.

389
00:34:17,323 --> 00:34:18,920
And I still believe that

390
00:34:19,139 --> 00:34:21,300
when our country truly changes,

391
00:34:22,100 --> 00:34:25,800
when everyone is free to choose their own path,

392
00:34:27,752 --> 00:34:29,400
our love will no longer

393
00:34:30,744 --> 00:34:33,400
have to remain a secret.

394
00:34:35,264 --> 00:34:38,265
I am not asking you to forgive me.

395
00:34:39,630 --> 00:34:40,860
I am not asking you

396
00:34:42,542 --> 00:34:44,480
to understand me right away.

397
00:34:47,998 --> 00:34:49,500
I just want

398
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:52,601
you to know that

399
00:34:55,176 --> 00:34:56,240
I've loved you

400
00:34:58,177 --> 00:34:59,178
every single day,

401
00:35:01,894 --> 00:35:03,500
and I always will.

402
00:35:42,126 --> 00:35:43,127
Your Highness.

403
00:35:44,127 --> 00:35:45,200
How is it?

404
00:35:47,411 --> 00:35:50,100
Did he agree to meet me?

405
00:36:00,766 --> 00:36:02,440
Tinnakorn asked me to give you this.

406
00:36:20,389 --> 00:36:24,240
On the day when the revolution started,

407
00:36:25,174 --> 00:36:26,800
his father followed him here

408
00:36:30,382 --> 00:36:32,801
and drag him back to be locked away in the palace.

409
00:36:33,704 --> 00:36:35,240
But Grandma and Aum

410
00:36:36,147 --> 00:36:37,680
helped him out of the palace.

411
00:36:45,616 --> 00:36:46,617
At first,

412
00:36:48,496 --> 00:36:50,640
he decided to run away with you.

413
00:36:52,544 --> 00:36:54,120
But before he even had a chance to see you,

414
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:56,880
everything fell apart.

415
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:08,001
He was willing

416
00:37:09,100 --> 00:37:10,101
to leave everything behind

417
00:37:11,291 --> 00:37:12,360
just to be with me.

418
00:37:14,272 --> 00:37:15,640
And how did I repay him?

419
00:37:21,995 --> 00:37:22,996
By betraying him.

420
00:37:53,557 --> 00:37:54,558
In the end,

421
00:38:00,182 --> 00:38:01,843
it turned out exactly as Prince Vasin said.

422
00:38:03,896 --> 00:38:06,200
I was never worthy of being with my prince.

423
00:38:31,459 --> 00:38:32,460
You have to do better.

424
00:38:33,094 --> 00:38:34,880
If my tree dies, I will be so mad at you.

425
00:38:35,536 --> 00:38:37,040
I am planting it neatly.

426
00:38:37,638 --> 00:38:38,639
You have to do a better job.

427
00:38:40,646 --> 00:38:43,168
Look at this spot, right here.

428
00:38:45,104 --> 00:38:46,360
And that spot, right there.

429
00:38:48,464 --> 00:38:50,720
Come on, you have to work harder, Mr. Phobthee.

430
00:38:52,342 --> 00:38:54,840
- Work harder? Really?
- Phob!

431
00:38:54,931 --> 00:38:56,125
Let me go!

432
00:38:57,640 --> 00:39:00,000
You are using me, you let me do all the work.

433
00:39:00,856 --> 00:39:01,857
Are you going to help me?

434
00:39:03,272 --> 00:39:06,120
You stink so bad, let me go!

435
00:39:06,339 --> 00:39:08,820
- Do I stink?
- That's right.

436
00:39:08,883 --> 00:39:11,440
- Do I stink?
- Yeah, you stink!

437
00:39:11,784 --> 00:39:12,785
You said I stink?

438
00:39:29,528 --> 00:39:30,529
Didn't you just say I stink?

439
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:52,000
Phob, I'm so happy.

440
00:39:55,544 --> 00:39:57,845
I want us to stay together like this forever.

441
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,401
Sure, we can.

442
00:40:10,100 --> 00:40:11,600
If you won't let go of my hand,

443
00:40:12,683 --> 00:40:14,684
I won't let go of yours.

444
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:22,001
That is not going to happen.

445
00:41:22,979 --> 00:41:25,700
Judging by the list of the 70 provisional representatives,

446
00:41:26,120 --> 00:41:27,360
there are roughly equal numbers from the Khana Ratsadon

447
00:41:27,721 --> 00:41:30,520
and senior officials of the old regime.

448
00:41:31,040 --> 00:41:33,560
I believe it's meant to demonstrate a willingness to compromise.

449
00:41:35,062 --> 00:41:36,496
Others may surrender if they want.

450
00:41:37,094 --> 00:41:40,760
But we're not going down without a fight. We have to find a way to get rid of them.

451
00:41:43,638 --> 00:41:44,639
Get them in the car.

452
00:41:45,382 --> 00:41:48,080
What's this? Where are you going?

453
00:41:53,931 --> 00:41:54,932
What did you say?

454
00:41:55,414 --> 00:41:59,560
Prince Noppalak was even forced into exile overseas?

455
00:42:02,464 --> 00:42:03,800
It's not just one palace.

456
00:42:04,891 --> 00:42:08,147
Many members of the royal family are now concerned for their safety.

457
00:42:09,032 --> 00:42:11,520
Some are preparing to go into exile in Penang,

458
00:42:12,638 --> 00:42:15,400
while others are planning to leave for Bandung on Java Island.

459
00:42:17,384 --> 00:42:19,840
Siam is truly entering a dark age.

460
00:42:21,275 --> 00:42:25,424
Will our family be safe after this?

461
00:42:26,816 --> 00:42:28,640
I'm starting to get scared.

462
00:42:28,843 --> 00:42:31,280
I don't think we should panic just yet.

463
00:42:33,206 --> 00:42:37,600
Most of the royals being targeted by the Khana Ratsadon

464
00:42:38,152 --> 00:42:40,153
are those in high-ranking positions who refused to compromise.

465
00:42:41,363 --> 00:42:44,320
Several others have expressed support

466
00:42:44,734 --> 00:42:47,240
for the change in government,

467
00:42:47,720 --> 00:42:49,400
and it looks like

468
00:42:49,467 --> 00:42:51,480
they'll be appointed to key positions in the new government.

469
00:42:51,883 --> 00:42:54,160
Cowards. Self-serving cowards.

470
00:42:54,934 --> 00:42:56,600
What a disgrace to the royal family.

471
00:42:58,011 --> 00:42:59,520
Everything's in chaos.

472
00:43:06,264 --> 00:43:08,840
We haven't been able to go to work for days.

473
00:43:09,165 --> 00:43:11,366
I can't even get into the ministry.

474
00:43:11,667 --> 00:43:13,640
Why are you so hardworking these days?

475
00:43:15,982 --> 00:43:17,640
I need to take care of something at work.

476
00:43:20,867 --> 00:43:25,400
The People's Committee of Siam is responsible for carrying out the Assembly's resolutions.

477
00:43:25,635 --> 00:43:27,680
It oversees government administration, including directing government officials,

478
00:43:27,827 --> 00:43:30,520
recommending appointments and dismissals,

479
00:43:30,814 --> 00:43:34,290
and submitting matters to His Majesty King Prajadhipok

480
00:43:34,547 --> 00:43:36,048
for royal signature

481
00:43:36,232 --> 00:43:40,000
and guidance on affairs of state.

482
00:43:40,566 --> 00:43:42,600
Are they going to dismiss government officials?

483
00:43:58,096 --> 00:44:00,200
Can't we get our money back first?

484
00:44:00,472 --> 00:44:02,000
I'm worried they'll investigate.

485
00:44:02,392 --> 00:44:05,800
If they find out I invested the ministry's money with you, I'm finished.

486
00:44:06,062 --> 00:44:09,560
Your Highness,

487
00:44:09,896 --> 00:44:11,720
can't you see how dangerous things have become?

488
00:44:14,115 --> 00:44:15,116
Come on.

489
00:44:15,806 --> 00:44:18,560
I don't think our luck is that bad.

490
00:44:30,341 --> 00:44:32,923
What? Are you going to shut down some of newspapers?

491
00:44:36,694 --> 00:44:38,160
I don't like doing this either.

492
00:44:40,318 --> 00:44:44,120
But supporters of the old regime attack us through the newspapers every day.

493
00:44:45,976 --> 00:44:47,760
Some even claim we're an oligarchy

494
00:44:48,227 --> 00:44:49,900
that only serves its own interests.

495
00:44:51,720 --> 00:44:54,760
But if we do this, we're destroying freedom.

496
00:44:55,360 --> 00:44:56,880
Before the change in government,

497
00:44:57,286 --> 00:44:59,800
every side debated through the newspapers.

498
00:45:01,603 --> 00:45:02,604
If we do this,

499
00:45:03,694 --> 00:45:05,750
can we really call it democracy?

500
00:45:07,198 --> 00:45:08,800
Let's just get through this first.

501
00:45:10,056 --> 00:45:11,800
Once everything settles down,

502
00:45:12,304 --> 00:45:15,400
I promise I'll speak to those in charge and make them understand.

503
00:45:16,038 --> 00:45:18,160
We fought for democracy.

504
00:45:18,800 --> 00:45:22,401
I know freedom is one of the most important values in this country.

505
00:45:28,083 --> 00:45:30,060
Phob, what do you think?

506
00:45:35,118 --> 00:45:37,920
I don't think it'll do any harm if it's only temporary.

507
00:45:40,119 --> 00:45:42,700
Right now, the country needs unity.

508
00:45:45,355 --> 00:45:46,750
Phob is right.

509
00:45:47,984 --> 00:45:50,122
The Assembly's work

510
00:45:50,854 --> 00:45:54,050
and the drafting of the constitution are proceeding smoothly.

511
00:45:54,912 --> 00:45:57,560
Even members of the royal family have been very cooperative.

512
00:45:58,400 --> 00:45:59,480
Except one thing.

513
00:46:08,606 --> 00:46:11,760
These government officials are to be dismissed immediately,

514
00:46:12,483 --> 00:46:15,784
as they may pose a threat to democracy.

515
00:46:31,360 --> 00:46:33,902
[M.C. Chatthorn Varakulvatin]
[M.C. Tinnakorn Varakulvatin]

516
00:46:41,640 --> 00:46:42,841
[M.C. Tinnakorn Varakulvatin]

517
00:46:48,902 --> 00:46:49,903
Really?

518
00:46:50,555 --> 00:46:53,360
Are all of you being forced to leave the ministries?

519
00:46:58,379 --> 00:47:00,320
Prince Chatthorn, please stay calm.

520
00:47:02,144 --> 00:47:04,360
They are trying to nip any opposition in the bud.

521
00:47:04,896 --> 00:47:06,619
The royals and government officials

522
00:47:06,768 --> 00:47:09,547
who came up under the old regime and refused to submit to them

523
00:47:09,686 --> 00:47:10,887
have all been dismissed.

524
00:47:13,163 --> 00:47:14,164
And it's not just us.

525
00:47:15,004 --> 00:47:18,720
The heads of the Provincial Police, the Opium Department,

526
00:47:19,179 --> 00:47:22,440
the Lands Department, and the Marine Department have all been dismissed.

527
00:47:24,400 --> 00:47:27,201
Dad…what are we going to do after this?

528
00:47:28,165 --> 00:47:29,200
What should we do?

529
00:47:30,299 --> 00:47:32,680
Don't you worry about your work.

530
00:47:32,944 --> 00:47:36,478
The ministry is a big organization. Even without you,

531
00:47:36,600 --> 00:47:38,600
they'll find someone else to do the job.

532
00:47:38,963 --> 00:47:40,216
Right now,

533
00:47:40,739 --> 00:47:45,360
we should be more concerned about our own lives and our safety.

534
00:47:45,700 --> 00:47:46,701
Okay, Grandma.

535
00:48:52,227 --> 00:48:53,228
Dad?

536
00:48:58,235 --> 00:48:59,236
Dad,

537
00:49:00,246 --> 00:49:01,247
I'm sorry.

538
00:49:01,984 --> 00:49:04,400
It's my fault everyone's suffering.

539
00:49:04,440 --> 00:49:06,180
I caused all of this.

540
00:49:08,547 --> 00:49:10,520
I told you, none of this is your fault.

541
00:49:13,300 --> 00:49:16,100
It's the traitors who betrayed our nation.

542
00:49:22,600 --> 00:49:24,240
But I'll never surrender to them.

543
00:49:26,323 --> 00:49:28,600
I won't let them destroy our Siam.

544
00:49:38,142 --> 00:49:39,143
Sir?

545
00:49:44,125 --> 00:49:46,500
I respectfully disagree with your decision to dismiss everyone

546
00:49:47,453 --> 00:49:48,560
from the Varakulvatin.

547
00:49:50,187 --> 00:49:53,720
Prince Vasin is the driving force behind the Blue Ribbon faction.

548
00:49:54,416 --> 00:49:57,760
The senior authorities believe that this group is intent on destroying us.

549
00:49:58,448 --> 00:49:59,449
Therefore,

550
00:50:00,224 --> 00:50:03,400
everyone from the Varakulvatin must be removed from government service,

551
00:50:03,942 --> 00:50:05,640
including Prince Tinnakorn.

552
00:50:06,411 --> 00:50:09,112
Prince Tinnakorn has nothing to do with the Blue Ribbon faction.

553
00:50:09,942 --> 00:50:11,440
I'd stake my life on it.

554
00:50:12,288 --> 00:50:16,120
If any of the senior authorities refuse to believe me,

555
00:50:20,334 --> 00:50:21,335
I'll meet with them personally.

556
00:50:22,472 --> 00:50:24,760
I know you're close to Prince Tinnakorn,

557
00:50:25,827 --> 00:50:29,040
but don't let your personal feelings stand in the way of the country's transformation.

558
00:50:32,147 --> 00:50:35,431
I've used my personal relationship with Prince Tinnakorn,

559
00:50:36,494 --> 00:50:38,680
and the trust he placed in me,

560
00:50:39,755 --> 00:50:40,880
to carry out our mission.

561
00:50:42,782 --> 00:50:44,283
You should trust my judgment.

562
00:50:45,595 --> 00:50:48,864
Prince Tinnakorn would never betray us.

563
00:50:48,944 --> 00:50:50,945
We've come this far. We can't afford to make any mistakes now, Phob.

564
00:50:51,000 --> 00:50:52,001
I know that.

565
00:50:54,078 --> 00:50:56,779
You can have me watch Prince Tinnakorn around the clock if you wish.

566
00:50:57,928 --> 00:50:59,200
But I ask just one thing,

567
00:51:00,419 --> 00:51:02,360
please don't dismiss him from government service.

568
00:51:09,494 --> 00:51:10,495
Sir,

569
00:51:11,936 --> 00:51:13,400
I've risked my life for this revolution

570
00:51:15,928 --> 00:51:17,600
just as everyone else has.

571
00:51:19,480 --> 00:51:22,960
I've never asked for a government position or any reward.

572
00:51:26,712 --> 00:51:27,880
This is the only request

573
00:51:29,507 --> 00:51:30,600
I've ever made of you.

574
00:51:35,182 --> 00:51:36,183
Phob, I am so sorry.

575
00:51:39,886 --> 00:51:41,800
This isn't my decision alone.

576
00:51:44,398 --> 00:51:45,560
The senior authorities believe

577
00:51:47,011 --> 00:51:48,803
this is the best course of action.

578
00:52:19,120 --> 00:52:21,590
Why? Why does it have to be you?

579
00:52:22,667 --> 00:52:24,280
Ever since I started working here,

580
00:52:24,544 --> 00:52:26,845
I've never met anyone more hardworking than you.

581
00:52:27,667 --> 00:52:29,120
Even though you're a prince,

582
00:52:30,216 --> 00:52:32,560
you never once left the work to low-ranking officials like me

583
00:52:33,651 --> 00:52:34,960
when he could have.

584
00:52:40,814 --> 00:52:42,160
Just think of it as fate

585
00:52:43,320 --> 00:52:45,120
playing a cruel joke on me.

586
00:53:07,443 --> 00:53:08,445
Your Highness.

587
00:53:11,740 --> 00:53:13,420
Captain Phobthee, what can I do for you, sir?

588
00:53:18,578 --> 00:53:19,620
I will help you

589
00:53:20,903 --> 00:53:21,904
with your job.

590
00:53:22,934 --> 00:53:25,935
I swear I will have you reinstated.

591
00:53:27,218 --> 00:53:29,780
I'll speak to the senior authorities myself. I give you my word.

592
00:53:30,060 --> 00:53:31,140
There's no need.

593
00:53:34,571 --> 00:53:36,240
I'm no longer of any use to you.

594
00:53:38,670 --> 00:53:39,750
You don't have to go through all that trouble for me.

595
00:53:47,441 --> 00:53:48,442
Your Highness.

596
00:53:50,150 --> 00:53:51,251
Please, Your Highness, don't do this.

597
00:53:53,490 --> 00:53:54,530
I know I've done wrong.

598
00:53:56,413 --> 00:53:58,890
I was at fault, and I'm truly sorry.

599
00:54:01,893 --> 00:54:03,650
But the love I have for you,

600
00:54:06,005 --> 00:54:07,430
it is real.

601
00:54:09,773 --> 00:54:10,774
Phob,

602
00:54:12,077 --> 00:54:13,410
if you could turn back time,

603
00:54:15,613 --> 00:54:16,890
would you do the same?

604
00:54:29,349 --> 00:54:30,350
I would.

605
00:54:38,794 --> 00:54:39,850
The change in the system

606
00:54:41,728 --> 00:54:42,930
was bound to happen, one way or another.

607
00:54:45,068 --> 00:54:46,750
But there's one thing I would never do,

608
00:54:47,996 --> 00:54:50,290
I would never drag you into this plan.

609
00:54:52,476 --> 00:54:54,690
I would never let you get hurt like this.

610
00:55:05,240 --> 00:55:06,241
I understand.

611
00:55:08,508 --> 00:55:10,030
I appreciate your honesty.

612
00:55:12,615 --> 00:55:13,616
I believe you.

613
00:55:20,569 --> 00:55:21,890
If you believe me,

614
00:55:24,630 --> 00:55:25,990
can we go back to normal?

615
00:55:27,431 --> 00:55:28,710
Please, don't leave me. Please?

616
00:55:30,132 --> 00:55:31,133
Phob.

617
00:55:33,412 --> 00:55:35,470
Phob, I understand your intentions.

618
00:55:36,585 --> 00:55:38,500
I understand what you stand for.

619
00:55:40,617 --> 00:55:43,190
And I truly believe that you want what's best for this country.

620
00:55:46,388 --> 00:55:47,389
But…

621
00:55:48,825 --> 00:55:50,790
we are two people who can't be in love.

622
00:55:52,761 --> 00:55:53,762
No!

623
00:55:54,470 --> 00:55:55,471
No! No!

624
00:55:56,300 --> 00:55:57,510
Please, don't be like this.

625
00:55:58,481 --> 00:55:59,990
I truly love you.

626
00:56:02,641 --> 00:56:03,642
Let me go.

627
00:56:12,662 --> 00:56:13,670
Goodbye.

628
00:56:16,273 --> 00:56:17,274
I wish you all the best.

629
00:57:26,190 --> 00:57:28,760
I don't want to put you in a position where you have to choose

630
00:57:29,280 --> 00:57:30,281
between me…

631
00:57:31,246 --> 00:57:32,600
and what you believe in.

632
00:57:32,982 --> 00:57:35,080
I'll be watching your success from afar.

633
00:57:42,480 --> 00:57:45,800
Prince Chatthorn, you have been accused of embezzlement.

634
00:57:47,870 --> 00:57:49,400
We can find that much money

635
00:57:49,640 --> 00:57:51,440
in two weeks.

